  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I fear I have not given you the friendliest of welcomes, dear Wizard. I thank you for dealing with our... embarrassing problem with Don de Gibbon.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Noble_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Don_Manzana_NV-PUERT_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562153,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Nonetheless, asking you to risk your life as soon as you arrive is in no way good manners. So come, let us dine on the succulent fruits of this-",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Noble_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Don_Manzana_NV-PUERT_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562153,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>*Booooooooom!*</ITALICS>",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Quest_LM_BOOM.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/SFX_NV-PUERT_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "By the Sacred Seeds of the Precious Pomegranate! That came from the Vale of Perfection! Our allies need our aid!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Noble_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Don_Manzana_NV-PUERT_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562153,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will assemble reinforcements. Go quickly, and may the Holy Fronds shade you from all evil!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So, our treacherous \"allies\" have finally come! I would put you in chains if I had a moment to spare!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You think me a dolt? Look! These unholy things attacking us - they are Monkeys! What horror have you unleashed upon us?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wait - you are the Wizard from Ravenwood, the one who fought Morganthe! Don Diego has told me much of you. I hear your words, and I trust you.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You have driven some of the creatures away, but there is no end to them! What are they?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Of course. You are very gracious. Now, how do we stop these creatures?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Silver? We have no lack of it! Wizard, gather Silver Berries from the plants of the valley and my soldiers will arm themselves against this threat!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "With these we will turn the tide.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_Unicorn_Guard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Captain_Argento_NV-PUERT_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562160,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
